UID:dothebay-17799228@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:Dónde la música y la memoria se encuentran. Join us for our 
 fourth annual Día de los Muertos celebration\, una noche en Michoacán\, 
 honoring tradition through art\, music\, and community. Gather with us for
  the unveiling of a special alebrije honoring Claude and celebrating the l
 ife of an Academy icon.\n\nIn partnership with CarnavalSF and Academy Lati
 ne affinity group CONCIENCIA\, we’re transforming the museum into a vibr
 ant showcase featuring traditional dances\, local makers\, and interactive
  experiences that bring this celebration and the Michoacana culture to lif
 e.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/nightlife-dia-de-los
 -muertos-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funche
 ap.com/da-de-los-muertos-nightlife-2026-cal-academy-sciences-sf/
