SUMMARY:5th Annual Kelly Brush Ride: Bay Area
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T160000
DTSTAMP:20261018T205153Z
UID:funcheap-1631372@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerKelly Brush Foundationoin us f
 or a fun day cycling the picturesque Marin County on Saturday\, October 24
 ! The 5th Annual Kelly Brush Ride: Bay Area is an incredible fundraising e
 vent that supports the Kelly Brush Foundation’s mission to inspire and e
 mpower people with spinal cord injuries to lead active and engaged lives.\
 nChoose from leisurely family-friendly jaunts to challenging routes for mo
 untain and road cyclists alike\; pick your route and pedal for a purpose. 
 Afterward\, join us for a post-ride celebration with delicious eats and dr
 inks\, music\, and prizes!\n\nCan’t make it to Mill Valley? No worries! 
 Join us remotely from anywhere\, anytime\, leading up to October 24. Every
  mile counts towards our mission.\n\n$85.00\n\nTickets: https://give.kelly
 brushfoundation.org/event/5th-annual-kelly-brush-ride-bay-area/e773797?c_s
 rc=EXP\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/5th-annual-kelly-brush-ride-bay-a
 rea/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bay-Ar
 ea-Ride.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T205153Z
LOCATION:Depot Plaza\, Mill Valley Ca\, Mill Valley
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/5th-annual-kelly-brush-ride-bay-area/
