DESCRIPTION:Presidio Riding ClubCelebrate fall at Horse Hallow\, an annual
  family-friendly celebration hosted by the Presidio Riding Club at Rodeo V
 alley Stables in the Marin Headlands. Set against the natural beauty of th
 e Headlands\, this seasonal gathering brings the community together for a 
 day of horses\, hands-on activities and festive fun.\nGuests can meet hors
 es dressed in Halloween costumes\, enjoy arts and crafts and face painting
 \, take photos with the horses\, and browse homemade treats at the bake sa
 le. Families are encouraged to come in costume and enjoy a welcoming event
  designed for horse lovers and first-time visitors alike.\nHorse Hallow al
 so helps support the Presidio Riding Club’s ongoing work to care for its
  facilities\, expand educational opportunities and strengthen its role as 
 a community resource. The Club provides a place for people to learn about 
 horses and horsemanship while building connections with one another and th
 e natural environment. Through partnerships with schools\, veterans’ gro
 ups and other community organizations\, the Club also supports educational
  workshops and programs that make its facilities and expertise accessible 
 to a broader community.\n\nLocated in the Marin Headlands\, the Presidio R
 iding Club is a volunteer-operated nonprofit dedicated to horse care\, hor
 semanship and environmental stewardship. As a partner of Golden Gate Natio
 nal Parks\, the Club helps connect visitors and local communities with the
