DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerChabot StaffHalloween Hike!\nA
 dults 21+\, $40\, Members receive $15 off\nImmersive Trek\n\nAs the sun di
 ps below the horizon and shadows stretch through the forest\, the Hallowee
 n Hike begins! Join us for a moderate\, 75–90 minute spine-tingling adve
 nture through the darkened trails of the majestic Oakland Redwood forest\,
  where ghostly tales and eerie surprises await.\nLed by our spooky expert 
 guides\, this haunted trek combines the thrill of exploration with chillin
 g stories sure to give you goosebumps. Dare to venture into the night and 
 uncover the secrets hidden among the trees. Come in costume to add to the 
 fun—you might even receive an extra treat! This hike is perfect for frie
 nds and family who are ready to embrace the Halloween spirit with a mix of
  adventure and fright.\n\nEnjoy a beautiful sunset hike:\nImmersive Trek: 
 5 PM\, between 2.5-3.5 miles\, approximately 120 minutes.\n\nAfter your hi
 ke\, unwind on Chabot’s Observation Deck with drinks and charcuterie. En
 d the night with stargazing through telescopes (weather permitting) and st
 ar stories brought to life under the night skies.\nTickets include two dri
 nk tickets (beer\, wine\, or non-alcoholic beverages) and refreshments. Th
 is program is for adults 21+.\n\n$40.00\n\nTickets: https://chabotspace.or
 g/calendar/hike-sip-13/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/hike-sip-3/\nSou
 rce: Funcheap SF
