 seteagarden-scaled-e1595352236641.jpeg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Japanese Tea Garden\, 75 Hagiwara Tea Garden Dr\, San Francisco\,
  CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
