 ing the heavens with glowing magic.\nBundle up\, bring a blanket\, and let
  the Geminids take center stage—no telescopes needed! With its radiant g
 low and breathtaking beauty\, this meteor shower promises a night of celes
 tial splendor you’ll never forget.\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://chabots
