DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Midnight Mystery Ride (Every Third Saturday)\nMi
 dnight Mystery Ride\nEvery third Saturday\, you are invited to bicycle wit
 h the San Francisco Midnight Mystery Ride as they set out to a new mystery
  location in SF.\nWhere to meet? They’ll post ride start locations on th
 eir website and Facebook page\, the day of the ride only\; there’s no ad
 vance warning. The ride happens every third Saturday.\nParticipants are ex
 pected to:\n\nMeet at a local bar before midnight on Saturday\nDepart for 
 a ride at midnight\nBring provisions for sharing at ride destination\nBe a
 wesome.\n\nRide start locations will be posted to their website the day of
  the ride. Only the ride leader knows where they’re going\, so bring you
 r sense of adventure. Rides are strictly NRLB (No Rider Left Behind) and g
 enerally around 5 miles – all levels of cyclist are welcome. They ride r
 ain or shine.\n\n– Updated 9/19/25 – Event info last checked via websi
 te\n\nUpcoming San Francisco Midnight Mystery Ride (Every Third Saturday) 
 Events\nSat 10/17 San Francisco Midnight Mystery Ride (Every Third Saturda
 y)Sat 11/21 San Francisco Midnight Mystery Ride (Every Third Saturday)Sat 
 12/19 San Francisco Midnight Mystery Ride (Every Third Saturday)Disclaimer
 : Please double check event information with the event organizer as events
