 y language and verbal skills to deescalate and deter assault and harassmen
 t\, as well as learn two simple and effective physical techniques.\nStuden
 ts who complete this class will receive a discount off a future full-lengt
 h Basics course. 1 Hour Intro classes are open to adults of all genders an
 d are totally free.\n\nIntro to Personal Safety & Self-Defense Class\nEver
 y 1st Wednesday of the Month | 6:30 to 7:30 pm\nSecret Location SF (locati
 on will be sent to you after RSVP)\nFREE\, but an RSVP is required\n– Up
