BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Francisco Botanical Garden’s Free Day (2nd Tuesdays)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270112T073000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270112T180000
DTSTAMP:20261016T211839Z
UID:funcheap-1642846@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Outdoors
DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Botanical Garden’s Free Day (2nd Tuesdays)\nSa
 xon Holt / SF Botanical Gardens\nThe San Francisco Botanical Garden is one
  of the most diverse gardens in the world. A unique urban oasis\, the gard
 en is a living museum within Golden Gate Park\, offering 55 acres of both 
 landscaped gardens and open spaces\, and showcasing over 9\,000 different 
 kinds of plants from around the world.\nOne of the most beautiful spots is
  the Japanese-design inspired “Moon Viewing Garden\,” (pictured above)
  located in the Mild-Temperate Climate section in the Northwest portion of
  the gardens. [view map]\nThe garden is always free for San Francisco resi
 dents\, but visitors can also enjoy this treasure for free on the second T
 uesday of every month\; plus it’s free on Thanksgiving\, Christmas Day\,
  and New Year’s Day for everyone.\n\nEarly bird? Come by any day and get
  in for free from 7:30-9 am.\nSan Francisco Botanical Garden Free Days\n\n
 Second Tuesday of every month\nThanksgiving\, Christmas & New Year’s Day
 \nFree daily from 7:30–9 am. Enter at the Main Gate only.\nAlways free f
 or San Francisco city and county residents (with proof of residency)\nAlwa
 ys free for Garden members and school groups\nUpdated 1/8/26\n\nRegular co
 st: Tickets start at $15 adults with discounts for kids/seniors\nHours\n\n
 Open Daily at 7:30am-Last Entry\nThe Garden closes one hour after last ent
 ry. Last entry changes seasonally.\nSpring & Summer Last Entry\n2nd Sunday
  in March – September: 6pm\nFall & Winter Last Entry\nFebruary – 2nd S
 unday in M...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://gggp.org/visit/admissions-hours/
 \nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-botanical-gardens-free-da
 y-2nd-tuesdays-67/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/holt_2
 86_4776-768x512.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261016T211839Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Botanical Garden\, 1199 9th Avenue\, San Francisco\
 , CA 94122
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/san-francisco-botanical-gardens-free-day-2nd-t
 uesdays-67/
